    - @crate::s3::S3Meta `{ key: String, size: u64, last_modified: i64 (ms UTC), etag: Option<String> }` et
      @crate::s3::S3PutResult `{ etag: Option<String> }`, `Clone`/`Debug`/`PartialEq` ;
